A COLLECTION OF BOOKMARKS
=========================

Just a collection of bookmarks. Feel free to use them if you find them helpful.


ALGORITHMS & INTERVIEWS
------------------------
- https://leetcode.com - The industry standard for coding interview preparation
- https://adventofcode.com - Daily December algorithm puzzles loved by the community
- https://www.bigocheatsheet.com - Essential visual guide for time and space complexity
- https://visualgo.net - Interactive data structure animations to visualize mechanics
- https://github.com/trekhleb/javascript-algorithms - Popular repo explaining algorithms in JS

COMPUTER SCIENCE FOUNDATIONS
----------------------------
- https://teachyourselfcs.com - The best self-study guide mapping core computer science subjects
- https://cs50.harvard.edu/x - World-renowned introductory CS course from Harvard
- https://github.com/ossu/computer-science - Complete self-taught CS curriculum using top university courses
- https://www.nand2tetris.org - Build a computer system from logic gates up to modern software
- https://pages.cs.wisc.edu/~remzi/OSTEP - Free, highly readable, standard textbook on Operating Systems
- https://missing.csail.mit.edu - Essential practical skills omitted from degree programs (Shell, Git, Vim)

LANGUAGES & PRACTICE
--------------------
- https://javascript.info - The absolute best, most comprehensive tutorial for JavaScript
- https://beej.us/guide/bgc - Legendary, practical guide to learning C programming
- https://doc.rust-lang.org/book - Official, definitive book for learning Rust
- https://en.cppreference.com - Definitive technical reference wiki for C and C++ standards
- https://gobyexample.com - Hands-on, concise tour of Go syntax and idioms
- https://learnxinyminutes.com - Swift syntax cheat sheets for almost any language

WEB & FRONTEND
--------------
- https://developer.mozilla.org - The authoritative MDN documentation for web APIs, JS, CSS, and HTML
- https://caniuse.com - Browser support tables for modern web features and standards
- https://web.dev - Google's official guide to modern web quality, performance, and PWA best practices
- https://www.patterns.dev - Modern design, rendering, and state management patterns for frontend apps

SYSTEMS & DEVOPS
----------------
- https://github.com/donnemartin/system-design-primer - Comprehensive guide to designing large-scale software systems
- https://craftinginterpreters.com - Masterful book showing how to build interpreters and compilers step by step
- https://man7.org/tlpi - Official site for "The Linux Programming Interface", the Linux Bible
- https://clig.dev - Design guidelines and principles for building command-line tools
- https://lazyvim.org - Modern, IDE-like Neovim setup for efficient terminal editing

CYBERSECURITY
-------------
- https://www.hackthebox.com - Top gamified platform for practicing penetration testing and ethical hacking
- https://portswigger.net/web-security - Exceptional free academy with practical web security labs
- https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten - Critical standard document identifying major web security risks

AI, MATH & DATA SCIENCE
-----------------------
- https://course.fast.ai - Premier hands-on, code-first course for deep learning
- https://distill.pub - Outstanding interactive journal breaking down ML research
- https://www.kaggle.com - Platform for data science competitions, datasets, and collaborative notebooks
- https://mml-book.github.io - Free textbook bridging fundamental linear algebra/calculus to ML

CAREER & PROJECTS
-----------------
- https://roadmap.sh - Community-driven, visual roadmaps for software developer career paths
- https://github.com/codecrafters-io/build-your-own-x - Step-by-step guides for building popular tools from scratch
- https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis - Comprehensive list of free APIs for personal projects
- https://free-for.dev - Curated list of cloud services, SaaS, and infrastructure offering free tiers

DESIGN, UX & GAME DEV
---------------------
- https://lawsofux.com - Essential psychological principles and heuristics applied to design
- https://refactoring.guru - Best visual guide to software design patterns and refactoring techniques
- https://gameprogrammingpatterns.com - Must-read book on writing clean, efficient code for games
- https://learnopengl.com - Step-by-step, comprehensive tutorials on computer graphics
